<a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions\" title=\"Champion of Champions\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">1</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions_2\" title=\"Champion of Champions 2\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">2</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions_3\" title=\"Champion of Champions 3\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">3</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions_4\" title=\"Champion of Champions 4\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">4</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions_5\" title=\"Champion of Champions 5\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">5</span></a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\"><small>New Year Treat:</small> <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_1\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">1</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_2\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">2</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_3\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">3</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_4\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">4</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_5\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">5</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_6\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">6</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_7\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sometimes_spit.\" title=\"Sometimes spit.\">Sometimes spit.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">An invisible jump rope.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/My_presumably_scrotum.\" title=\"My presumably scrotum.\">My presumably scrotum.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Midnight_picnic.\" title=\"Midnight picnic.\">Midnight picnic.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Maybe_we%27re_the_monsters.\" title=\"Maybe we&#39;re the monsters.\">Maybe we're the monsters.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/It%27s_got_to_be_obsolete.\" title=\"It&#39;s got to be obsolete.\">It's got to be obsolete.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glass_half_most.\" title=\"Glass half most.\">Glass half most.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Science_all_your_life.\" title=\"Science all your life.\">Science all your life.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Getaway_sticks.\" title=\"Getaway sticks.\">Getaway sticks.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_clever_side%3F\" title=\"The clever side?\">The clever side?</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">An invisible jump rope.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d6/An_invisible_jump_rope..png/revision/latest?cb=20250508220005\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"An invisible jump rope.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d6/An_invisible_jump_rope..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250508220005\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d6/An_invisible_jump_rope..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250508220005 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d6/An_invisible_jump_rope..png/revision/latest?cb=20250508220005 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"An invisible jump rope.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"An_invisible_jump_rope..png\" data-image-name=\"An invisible jump rope..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_19\" title=\"Series 19\">19</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\">Mathew Baynton</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sometimes_spit.\" title=\"Sometimes spit.\">Sometimes spit.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/My_presumably_scrotum.\" title=\"My presumably scrotum.\">My presumably scrotum.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>An invisible jump rope.</b></i> is the second episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_19\" title=\"Series 19\">Series 19</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 8 May 2025. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\">Mathew Baynton</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/An_invisible_jump_rope.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\">Jason Mantzoukas</a> suggests that everyone \"Imagine there’s an invisible jump rope in there\", before footage of <a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\">Stevie Martin</a>’s strange jumping gait during the <a href=\"/wiki/Give_Alex_exactly_100_marbles_on_a_plate_and_an_eggcup_full_of_tepid_water\" title=\"Give Alex exactly 100 marbles on a plate and an eggcup full of tepid water\">Give Alex exactly 100 marbles on a plate and an eggcup full of tepid water</a> task is replayed yet again on the screen, in the studio. A duck made of ice filled with marbles sits next to a microphone in the title card. The duck is a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Get_the_most_liquid_in_this_can\" title=\"Get the most liquid in this can\">Get the most liquid in this can</a> task, the marbles come from the <a href=\"/wiki/Give_Alex_exactly_100_marbles_on_a_plate_and_an_eggcup_full_of_tepid_water\" title=\"Give Alex exactly 100 marbles on a plate and an eggcup full of tepid water\">Give Alex exactly 100 marbles on a plate and an eggcup full of tepid water</a> task, and the microphone comes from the <a href=\"/wiki/Commentate_on_yourself_achieving_something_really_tricky,_then_achieve_that_really_tricky_thing\" title=\"Commentate on yourself achieving something really tricky, then achieve that really tricky thing\">Commentate on yourself achieving something really tricky, then achieve that really tricky thing</a> task.</p><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/An_invisible_jump_rope.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"line-height: 1;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 0 5px 5px 5px;\">&#8220;\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.5;\"><i>The first team task of the series brings the usual awkwardness, but also the joys of <a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\">Stevie Martin</a> inventing a new way for humans to move, and <a href=\"/wiki/Fatiha_El-Ghorri\" title=\"Fatiha El-Ghorri\">Fatiha El-Ghorri</a> sweeping the lawn with a small broom. Elsewhere, <a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\">Rosie Ramsey</a> has a visceral reaction to mental arithmetic, <a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\">Mathew Baynton</a> strikes his own face with a grape, and <a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\">Jason Mantzoukas</a> destroys a shower.</i>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 5px 5px -3px 5px;\">&#8221;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\">- British Comedy Guide\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><small><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.comedy.co.uk/tv/taskmaster/episodes/19/2/\">[1]</a></small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Fatiha_El-Ghorri\" title=\"Fatiha El-Ghorri\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Fatiha El-Ghorri</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jason Mantzoukas</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mathew Baynton</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rosie Ramsey</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Stevie Martin</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Snootiest_thing\" title=\"Snootiest thing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Snootiest thing.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Commentate_on_yourself_achieving_something_really_tricky,_then_achieve_that_really_tricky_thing\" title=\"Commentate on yourself achieving something really tricky, then achieve that really tricky thing\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Commentate on yourself achieving something really tricky, then achieve that really tricky thing.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Give_Alex_exactly_100_marbles_on_a_plate_and_an_eggcup_full_of_tepid_water\" title=\"Give Alex exactly 100 marbles on a plate and an eggcup full of tepid water\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Give Alex exactly 100 marbles on a plate and an eggcup full of tepid water. One of you must always be sitting down, one of you must always be jumping and one of you must always be clapping your hands. You must each change your action every 30 seconds and no-one may hold anything for more than five seconds at a time.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_the_most_liquid_in_this_can\" title=\"Get the most liquid in this can\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Get the most liquid in this can. You may not leave the Submaravan.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/Put_one_of_your_items_completely_inside_the_other_item\" title=\"Put one of your items completely inside the other item\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Choose an item from each box and place them on the corresponding half of your table.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">2\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Live:</b> One at a time, pass the item on your right to the person on your right and the item on your left to the person on your left.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Live:</b> Put one of your items completely inside the other item.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">23\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/An_invisible_jump_rope.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a>'s opening banter segment was cut from this episode, likely for time. The section involved Alex stating he had the hiccups and that he found a cure, which required <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> to caress his hand and whisper to him, before Greg whispers he'd like to have sex with Alex.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"m